      "issue": "test_l2_tokens_not_higher_than_before has no specified baseline-extraction method (e.g. git show HEAD:<path> per skill before the executor's commit). Left undefined, the test is easy to write in a way that trivially passes without comparing against the real pre-rewrite body.",
